# radar.db, web/public/data.json and web/public/ai_radar_report.csv are
# committed on purpose (git-scraping): the bot refreshes them every 6 hours and
# each push triggers a Vercel deploy that serves the new data. The snapshot
# history must also persist between runs so momentum can be computed.

